# Beatrix, Loyal General: "you may attach any number of Equipment you control to target creature you control" (CR 701.3a, 507.1). The trigger takes only a creature of Bot1's (Bot2's Mother of Runes and Lightning Greaves are refused). On turn 5 Bot1 attaches nothing; on turn 7 both Equipment are in play and both go to Beatrix.

